// Title: Suspicious Ping/Del Command Combination
// Rule ID: 54786ddc-5b8a-11ed-9b6a-0242ac120002
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1070.004
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_sentinel
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_cmd_ping_del_combined_execution.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
